		{"id":"dcf8ecbb2cb8f44b","type":"text","text":"\n1. 先写目标\n---\n\n目标：\n\nEvision circlegauge matching show results 功能\n```\n核心功能：\n- circle gauge\n- matching\n- show result\n- camera 整合\n```\n先定义“要做什么”，不要先想代码。","x":-320,"y":-8760,"width":340,"height":616},
		{"id":"b212031fe1af23d4","type":"text","text":"5. 写最小版本 coding\n---\n\n第1步：\n建立 Gauge → 设置大概圆 → Measure → 读取圆心和半径\n第2步：\nShow position/Measured Results Save/Load Xml ","x":-320,"y":-8015,"width":250,"height":740},
