		{"id":"00c1e696a3177c91","type":"text","text":"以后每新增一个功能，都先写这六项：\n---\n功能名称：\nCircleGauge Matching show results\n\n输入：\nEImageC24 parentImage\nEROIC24 myRoi\nEROIC24 myRoi2\nEmatcher Matcher\n\n演算法：\n\n\n输出：\nEImageC24 croppedImage\n\n流程：\n1. 检查图片\n2. 检查 ROI\n3. 建立输出图片\n4. learn match pattern\n5. 显示结果\n\n异常：\n","x":780,"y":-7955,"width":460,"height":840},
