		{"id":"d297b90575201173","type":"text","text":"2. 用 Obsidian Canvas 拆功能\n---\n把大功能拆小：\n\nCamera Vision System\n├─ Camera Connection\n│  ├─ Auto Search\n│  ├─ Connect\n│  └─ Disconnect\n├─ Acquisition\n│  ├─ Live\n│  ├─ Single Shot\n│  └─ Software Trigger\n├─ Image Processing\n│  ├─ crop\n│  ├─ match\n│  ├─ circleGauge\n│  └─ Show result\n└─ ROI Setting\n   ├─ Scale\n   ├─ Angle\n   ├─ Min Score\n   ├─ Max Occurance\n└─ Gauge Setting\n   ├─ Samples\n   ├─ Valid Samples\n└─ Settings\n   ├─ Width\n   ├─ Height\n   ├─ Exposure\n   ├─ Gain\n   └─ Gamma\n","x":100,"y":-9240,"width":320,"height":1145},
