		{"id":"d75309d094c823e5","type":"text","text":"4. 决定 Class 分工 分类 frontend / backend \n---\n例如：\n\nMainForm\n负责按钮、PictureBox、界面更新\n\nCameraService\n负责 Search、Connect、Live、Single Shot\n\nImageService\n负责 ROI、Crop、Save,Gauge\n\nConfigService\n负责 XML Save / Load\n\nAppConfig\n负责保存 Exposure、Gain、Gamma 数据\n\n","x":780,"y":-8875,"width":320,"height":800},
